            "date": null,
            "scope": "Gated (pemmican/curing). Items for the human reviewer: (1) the page gives no recipe, ratio, time or storage duration for pemmican; (2) it reproduces the 160 F / 165 F jerky heat-step figures with attribution, and states that USDA FSIS (heat before dehydrating; home jerky 1 to 2 months) and NCHFP (heat before or after drying; 2 weeks at room temperature) differ; (3) the verdict is not-validated for lack of any regulator source on pemmican. Also recommended: cultural read-through by someone with standing in the communities named, before publication."
